`cJSON_InitHooks` sets cJSON’s global memory hooks. Call it once before using cJSON to replace `malloc/free/realloc`; pass `NULL` to reset to defaults. `realloc` is enabled only when both hooks are the standard `malloc` and `free`; otherwise it stays `NULL`.
