​ `cJSON_Print` renders a `cJSON` value into a newly allocated, pretty-printed JSON text string using the global hooks. Use it to serialize an item for display/storage, then free the returned buffer with the matching allocator. If `item` is `NULL` or allocation fails, it returns `NULL`.
