​ ```
3. `cJSON_InsertItemInArray`
​ Inserts `newitem` into `array` at index `which`. Use with a valid array and non-NULL item. If `which<0` or `newitem==NULL`, it returns false. If index is past the end, it appends. It also fails on corrupted array links.
